    {"name": "lowered-count-preference-is-lazy-first", "pattern": "a{1,3}?b", "subject": "aaab", "expect": {"match": [0, 4]}, "note": "the generated optionals nest so the k-th copy is decided before the (k+1)-th, which is what makes a wrong nesting visible here"},
